  "aiContextParagraph": "The Bareskrim Polri is intensifying its investigation into an alleged treason plot involving the unauthorized wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto. Investigators have reported the discovery of new evidence and information gathered from multiple sites, including searches conducted at suspected coordination posts. To ensure thoroughness, the police have engaged the National Police Commission and various experts in their legal review process. The investigation focuses on serious criminal allegations that necessitate rigorous evidentiary standards, according to official statements. Currently, police have completed examinations of four primary suspects as well as several witnesses who may possess relevant knowledge of the case. Plans are now in motion for the Bareskrim Polri to coordinate with the Attorney General's Office to facilitate a formal joint exposition of the case, marking a significant step in the ongoing legal proceedings surrounding these treason claims.",
